! Test v1.07.3: closed-shell SAD half-density convention.
! H2O HF/STO-3G with an EXPLICIT %initial_guess sad.  Before v1.07.3
! the RHF SAD wrapper returned the full density (twice the electrons
! of the half-density convention), so iteration 1 sat at -92.63 Ha;
! with the fix it starts at -82.78 and iteration 2 is already at
! -74.90.  The converged total must equal the core-H-guess run:
! Expected:  Total energy:  -74.963018251621
%method  HF
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%initial_guess sad
*geometry angstrom
 O   0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
 H   0.000000    0.757200   -0.469200
 H   0.000000   -0.757200   -0.469200
*end
